The following is a '''timeline''' that attempts to provide an overview of the important and historical events which occurred in the world of [[Lord of Mysteries (Novel)|''Lord of Mysteries'']] and [[Circle of Inevitability (Novel)|''Circle of Inevitability'']].

Be aware that the series rarely describes historical events with specific time periods, so details, especially concerning when they may have taken place, are not concrete.

;<u>Notes</u>
* The reference point is at [[#Year1349|Year 1349 of the 5th Epoch]], when Zhou Mingrui transmigrated as [[Klein Moretti]].
* The time before this may notated with "'''BA'''" (Before Arrival) and "'''c.'''" (''circa'', meaning around, or approximately)
** e.g. '''c.300 BA''' means "around 300 years before the arrival of Zhou Mingrui.")
* Date format is YYYY-Mon-DD.

<u>'''Notes 2'''</u>: Characters birthday are collected from Chinese LOTM fan spreadsheets:  [https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1fxRmF42epaPPa3D7aaSNAnKSsoH9rdzd315ig-iF8S8/ ''Mysteries - Various Setting''].
