==The Future==
* The [[God of Knowledge and Wisdom]] has prophesied that [[The Apocalypse]] will happen in the year '''1368''' of the Fifth Epoch.<ref>{{Cite Book|1|1099}}</ref>
* [[Xio Derecha]] once claimed that the day a [[Beyonder]] could live a carefree life might only be attainable at the end of the Fifth Epoch and the beginning of the Sixth Epoch, if there is even a Sixth Epoch at all.<ref>{{Cite Book|2|287}}</ref>

